WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
My senior year was very rewarding to me.

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.920
I went to Mossville with a group of many.

3
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:15.320
But to be able to graduate as the only girl from that group was an honor.

4
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:19.180
I finished in the top ten.

5
00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:25.840
I received the “I Dare You” award, which was to . . . for me to dare,

6
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:31.160
challenges that they saw in me that I didn't know I had in me.

7
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:35.420
I received the American Legion award.

8
00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:44.280
So there was a lot of things that the community of Mossville saw in me and allowed me to be me,

9
00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:47.220
for me to be who I am today.

10
00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:51.920
So that setting, I had all of this talent in me.

11
00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:58.160
People accepted my talent and . . . One of the things I want to say about my instructors also:

12
00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:07.620
they saw in me things that made me happy being who I was.

13
00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:20.360
And they never let the money I didn't have hinder me, because someone would always give me the money for that costume, for that trip.

14
00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:27.760
We went to American Bandstand when it was in Beaumont, Texas.

15
00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:33.200
I don't know who paid my way, but I went, knowing that I didn't have the money to go.
